<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="경인여대생을 위한 예산과 거리 기반 식사 메뉴 추천"><title>밥잇 | 오늘 한 끼, 내 예산 안에서</title><link rel="icon" href="/assets/bapit-logo.png"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css"></head>
<body><a class="skip" href="#recommend">맛집 찾기로 바로가기</a><div class="site-shell">
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/assets/bapit-logo.png" alt="밥잇 로고"><span class="brand-copy"><strong>밥잇</strong><small>경인여대생 맛집 추천</small></span></a><button class="menu-toggle" id="menuToggle" aria-label="메뉴 열기" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="mainNav">☰</button><nav class="nav" id="mainNav" aria-label="주요 메뉴"><a href="#recommend" data-nav="recommend">맛집 찾기</a><a href="#favorites" data-nav="favorites">찜한 맛집</a><a href="#recent" data-nav="recent">최근 본 식당</a><button class="login-btn" id="loginOpen">로그인 / 회원가입</button></nav></header>
<main><section class="intro section"><div><span class="eyebrow">경인여대 앞, 오늘의 한 끼</span><h1>내 예산에 딱 맞는<br><em>학교 앞 맛집</em>을 찾아보세요.</h1><p>먹고 싶은 메뉴와 가까운 식당을 한 번에.</p></div><img src="/assets/bapit-logo.png" alt="" class="intro-logo"></section>
<section id="recommend" class="finder section"><div class="section-heading"><h2>오늘은 얼마로 먹을까요?</h2><span class="hint">학교 기준 거리 · 1인 메뉴 가격</span></div><form class="finder-card" id="searchForm"><div class="field-group budget-field"><label for="budget">한 끼 예산</label><div class="budget-input"><span>₩</span><input id="budget" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*" maxlength="5" autocomplete="off" value="10000" required aria-describedby="budgetHelp"><span>원 이하</span><span class="budget-steps"><button type="button" class="budget-step" data-step="500" aria-label="예산 500원 올리기">▲</button><button type="button" class="budget-step" data-step="-500" aria-label="예산 500원 내리기">▼</button></span></div><small id="budgetHelp" class="budget-help">3,000~30,000원 · 숫자만 입력 · ▲▼ 버튼이나 ↑↓ 키로 500원씩 조절</small><div class="budget-chips"><button type="button" data-budget="6000">6천원</button><button type="button" data-budget="8000">8천원</button><button type="button" class="active" data-budget="10000">1만원</button><button type="button" data-budget="15000">1.5만원</button></div></div><div class="field-group category-field"><label id="categoryLabel">음식 카테고리</label><div class="category-grid" aria-labelledby="categoryLabel">
<button type="button" class="category active" data-category="all" aria-pressed="true"><span>🍽️</span>전체</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="korean" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍚</span>한식</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="noodle" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍜</span>면</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="ricebowl" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍛</span>덮밥</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="japanese" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍣</span>일식</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="chinese" aria-pressed="false"><span>🥟</span>중식</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="snack" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍢</span>분식</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="fastfood" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍔</span>패스트푸드</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="salad" aria-pressed="false"><span>🥗</span>샐러드&amp;포케</button><button type="button" class="category" data-category="western" aria-pressed="false"><span>🍝</span>양식</button></div></div><button class="search-btn" type="submit">맛집 찾기</button></form></section>
<section class="recommend-section section" id="results"><div class="section-heading results-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="resultCount" aria-live="polite">식당을 찾고 있어요</span><h2 id="resultTitle">예산 안의 <em>추천 메뉴</em></h2></div><div class="result-controls" id="sortControls"><button class="sort active" data-sort="recommend" aria-pressed="true">추천순</button><button class="sort" data-sort="distance" aria-pressed="false">거리순</button><button class="sort" data-sort="price" aria-pressed="false">가격순</button></div></div><p class="sample-notice">메뉴를 누르면 오른쪽 지도에서 식당 위치를 보여줘요. 가격은 조사 시점 기준이라 실제와 다를 수 있어요.</p><div class="result-layout"><div class="result-column"><div class="result-list" id="resultList" data-list="search" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="pager" id="pager" hidden><button type="button" class="pager-btn" id="prevPage" aria-label="이전 추천 메뉴 5개">&lt;</button><span id="pageInfo" aria-live="polite">1 / 1</span><button type="button" class="pager-btn" id="nextPage" aria-label="다음 추천 메뉴 5개">&gt;</button></div></div><aside class="map-panel"><div id="kakaoMap" class="map-canvas"><div class="map-empty"><b>학교 주변 지도로 확인하기</b><p id="mapStatus">지도를 준비하고 있어요.</p></div></div><div class="map-legend"><span>📍 경인여자대학교 기준</span><span>직선거리</span></div></aside></div><details class="algorithm"><summary>밥잇은 어떻게 추천하나요?</summary><p>식당마다 예산 이하의 메뉴 중 점수가 가장 높은 메뉴 하나를 추천합니다. 점수는 가격 여유 60%와 학교까지의 직선거리 40%로 계산해요. 가까운 식당의 저렴한 메뉴일수록 높은 점수를 받아요. 표시는 도보 경로 거리가 아닙니다.</p></details></section>
<section class="my-section section" id="favorites" aria-labelledby="favoritesTitle"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="favoritesCount" aria-live="polite">내 식당 목록</span><h2 id="favoritesTitle">다시 가고 싶은 <em>찜한 맛집</em></h2></div></div><div class="result-list my-list" id="favoritesList" data-list="favorites" aria-live="polite"></div></section>
<section class="my-section section" id="recent" aria-labelledby="recentTitle"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow" id="recentCount" aria-live="polite">내 식당 목록</span><h2 id="recentTitle">최근 확인한 <em>식당</em></h2></div></div><div class="result-list my-list" id="recentList" data-list="recent" aria-live="polite"></div></section></main>
<footer class="footer"><div class="footer-brand"><img src="/assets/bapit-logo.png" alt=""><b>밥잇</b></div><p>경인여대생을 위한 식사 메뉴 추천 서비스 · 행복이조 · Capstone Design 2026</p></footer></div>
<dialog id="authDialog" class="modal"><button class="modal-close" data-close="authDialog" aria-label="닫기">×</button><img src="/assets/bapit-logo.png" class="modal-logo" alt=""><h2 id="authTitle">밥잇에 오신 것을 환영해요!</h2><p>내가 찜한 식당과 식사 후기를 모아보세요.</p><form id="authForm"><label id="nameField" hidden>닉네임<input id="authName" maxlength="20" autocomplete="nickname"></label><label>이메일<input id="authEmail" type="email" maxlength="254" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="example@kiwu.ac.kr"></label><label>비밀번호<input id="authPassword" type="password" required minlength="8" maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="8자 이상"></label><p class="form-error" id="authError" role="alert"></p><button class="primary-btn full" id="authSubmit" type="submit">로그인</button></form><button class="signup-link" id="switchAuth">처음 오셨나요? 회원가입</button></dialog>
<dialog id="detailDialog" class="review-modal" aria-labelledby="detailTitle"><button class="modal-close" data-close="detailDialog" aria-label="닫기">×</button><div id="detailBody"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="reviewDialog" class="review-modal" aria-labelledby="reviewTitle"><button class="modal-close" data-close="reviewDialog" aria-label="닫기">×</button><div id="reviewBody"></div><form id="reviewForm" class="review-form-wrap"><b>나도 후기 남기기</b><p id="reviewHint">로그인한 계정당 식당별 후기 한 개를 저장하며 다시 작성하면 수정됩니다.</p><label for="rating">별점</label><select id="rating" required><option value="">선택해 주세요</option><option value="5">★★★★★ 5점</option><option value="4">★★★★☆ 4점</option><option value="3">★★★☆☆ 3점</option><option value="2">★★☆☆☆ 2점</option><option value="1">★☆☆☆☆ 1점</option></select><label for="comment">후기</label><textarea id="comment" rows="3" maxlength="300" required placeholder="맛, 가격, 분위기를 알려주세요."></textarea><p id="reviewError" class="form-error" role="alert"></p><button class="primary-btn" type="submit">후기 저장</button></form></dialog><div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div><script type="module" src="/js/app.js"></script></body></html>